:: Mine Revolt
<<effects>><<mine_distract_check>><<person1>>

<<switch _distraction_count>>
	<<case 0>>
		<<shackle_feet>>
		You run into the <<person>> and knock <<him>> down. You get surrounded by guards coming to <<his>> aid, too many to fight off. They restrain you and lock shackles around your ankles. The <<person>> drags you into the tunnels. <<mine_hope -3>><<lllhope>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>>
		You run into the <<person>> and knock <<him>> down. Three other guards come to <<his>> aid.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><<set $phase to 4>><</link>>
	<<case 2>>
		<<generate2>>
		You run into the <<person>> and knock <<him>> down. Another guard comes to <<his>> aid.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
	<<case 3>>
		You grab a disused shovel and bash <<him>> on the head. <<He>> falls to the ground unconscious. <<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight Victory]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<default>>
		<<shackle_feet>>
		You grab a disused shovel and attempt to bash <<him>> on the head, but a bug stops you. You should report this in the bug-reports channel of the Degrees of Lewdity discord server, make sure you include a screenshot and save. You get surrounded by guards, too many to fight off. They restrain you and lock shackles around your ankles. The <<person>> drags you into the tunnels.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>
<</switch>>



:: Mine Revolt Fight

<<if $fightstart is 1>>
	<<set $fightstart to 0>>
	<<set $enemyno to $phase>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<npcidlegenitals>>
	<<person1>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Revolt Fight End
<<effects>>

<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<set $mine.job.mining.shackle to 8>>
	<<tearful>> you knock them to the ground.
	<<clotheson>>
	<<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight Victory]]>><<endcombat>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<tearful>> you step back victoriously as they fall to the ground in bliss.
	<<clotheson>>
	<<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Fight Victory]]>><<endcombat>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<shackle_feet>>
	"Hope you learned your lesson, <<bitch>>," the <<person1>><<person>> says as <<he>> locks your ankles in a pair of shackles.
	<<clotheson>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you are grabbed and shoved into a <<endcombat>><<generate1>><<person1>><<person>> who drags you into the tunnels. <<mine_hope -3>><<lllhope>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Revolt Fight Victory
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>

You grab the keys off the guard's belt.
<<if $mine.hope gte 30 and $mine.song>>
	You turn to the line of slaves. One of them shouts, "Look behind you!" You quickly turn to see a <<person>> lunging at you, <span class="green">but you're able to dodge out of the way in time.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> crashes to the ground. You take the chance to toss the keys to one of the slaves who immediately starts helping others unlock their shackles. <<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Revolt Free]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<shackle_feet>>
	You turn to the line of slaves. One of them is staring behind you. You quickly turn to see a <<person>> lunging at you. <span class="red">You try to dodge but <<he>> tackles you to the ground.</span><<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
	<br><br>
	You crash to the ground. <<He>> takes the chance to shackle you. <<He>> pulls you up and drags you into the tunnels. <<mine_hope -3>><<lllhope>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Revolt Free
<<effects>><<generate1>>

Guards start pouring into the tunnel, <span class="blue">but they're overwhelmed by the slaves.</span> A yell cuts through the noise. You look at the source and see a <<person1>><<person>> flanked by half a dozen guards. They're all holding guns.
<br><br>
"You all will put your shackles back on, or we will open fire," the <<person>> yells. Silence envelops the tunnel.
<br><br>
<<if $mine.setup.weapons>>
	<<link [[Step forward|Mine Revolt Gun Forward]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Surrender|Mine Revolt Gun Back]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Revolt Gun Back
<<effects>><<shackle_feet>>

You step towards the pile of unlocked shackles and put one on. The rest of the slaves follow suit. The <<person>> walks up and grabs you, pulling you with <<him>>. <<mine_hope -3>><<lllhope>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Revolt Gun Forward
<<effects>>

You step forward. The guards surrounding the <<person>> look at each other, confused. "Okay… You chose this," <<he>> says. A singular click cuts through the silence, followed by a series of frantic clicks. <span class="green">The guns don't work.</span> Fear fills the faces of the guards. <<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
<br><br>
The guards retreat into the tunnels immediately, followed by the pursuing slaves.
<<if $mine.setup.map>>
	<span class="blue">You remember the map in the guards' room.</span> You can use it to find your way out. 
	Not wasting any time, you rush to the guard's room and grab the map before returning to the tunnel.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow them|Mine Revolt Follow]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Mine Revolt Follow
<<effects>>

You follow the slaves into the tunnel system. You quickly lose the guards.
<<if $mine.setup.map>>
	You pull out the map and use it to guide you towards the exit. On the way, you run into the other slaves while they're beating up the guards with the guns. "Follow me!" you yell. <<mine_hope 3>><<ggghope>>
	<br><br>
	Not knowing what else to do, the slaves follow you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Find the exit|Mine Revolt Gate]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>><<shackle_feet>>
	You run around the twisting tunnels until you're blindsided by a guard, who quickly locks a pair of shackles around your ankles. "<<pShe>>'s the last of them." the <<person1>><<person>> says to a <<person2>><<person>>.<<mine_hope -3>><<lllhope>><<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
	<br><br>
	The <<person1>><<person>> lifts you off the ground and drags you into the tunnels.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Revolt Gate
<<effects>><<generate1>>

You and the others approach a heavily fortified gate. Two guards stand behind it. "You better just give up. You can't get through this gate," a <<person1>><<person>> yells from behind the gate, barely concealing the fear in <<his>> voice. <<He>>'s right. Even all of you combined couldn't get through.
<br><br>
<<if $mine.bomb.progress gte 10>>
	<<link [[Use the bomb|Mine Revolt Bomb]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Wait|Mine Revolt Gate Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Mine Revolt Gate Wait
<<effects>><<generate1>><<shackle_feet>>

Not knowing what else to do, you wait. Eventually, a group of guards wearing riot gear rush through the gate. The other slaves start to scatter into the tunnels. You attempt to do the same, but a <<person1>><<person>> tackles you to the ground and locks a pair of shackles around your ankles. <<He>> stands you up and drags you into the tunnels. <<mine_hope -3>><<lllhope>><<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Revolt Bomb
<<effects>><<earnFeat "Down Below">><<earnFeat "The Time is Now">>
<<badEndTrackingEnd "Mines" { reason: "minesRevolt" }>><<set $mine.freed to 1>><<world_corruption "hard" -1>>
<<set $location to "town">><<set $outside to 1>>

You pull out the bomb you made and walk up to the gate. The guards look at you in confusion before their faces turn white with the realisation of what you're holding.
<br><br>
You set down the bomb, right in front of the gate. You look up and see that the guards are already long gone. Not wanting to waste time, you arm the bomb and run for cover. The other slaves are way ahead of you. You brace yourself and cover your ears before a loud boom shakes your surroundings.
<br><br>
You look to see the damage, <span class="green">the gate has been blown off, along with a large amount of rock.</span>
<br><br>
Before you can go through, a horde of people rush past you, almost knocking you down. You don't hesitate to follow. You reach a staircase leading to a metal door. You quickly walk up and go through and emerge at the bottom of the flats on Barb Street.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Barb Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
